  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Life; <strong>CL</strong> 1st<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 50 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.1 lbs.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nMade from blessed water, a cleansing potion removes the fatigued, sickened, and battered conditions, and lessens exhausted and nauseated by one step. If the status conditions healed or lessened are part of an ongoing effect, it only suppresses or reduces the effect for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nDistill Compound, Life sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 25 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/compounds#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Reviewed selection: 50 gp.</p><p>One blessed-water dose. Preserve the exact named conditions and ongoing-effect exception; no permanent active change, generic Lesser Restoration rules or automatic condition deletion.</p><p>Single-dose quantity is consumed through the native helper. Target outcomes, temporary effects and any external eligibility remain deliberate; carrying the bottle grants no persistent bonus.</p>",
